# Optional: FlightAware AeroAPI key for richer live data (route, ETA, positions
# outside ground-station ADS-B coverage, e.g. mid-ocean). Without it, the app
# uses free ADS-B feeds (adsb.lol, airplanes.live) and adsbdb for routes.
# Get a key at https://www.flightaware.com/aeroapi/
FLIGHTAWARE_API_KEY=

# Optional: FlightRadar24 blocks some hosts' egress IPs (e.g. Vercel) while
# allowing others (e.g. Cloudflare Workers). If route lookups are stale on
# this deployment but correct on another deployment of this app, set this to
# the working deployment's base URL and lookups will be relayed through it.
# Example: ROUTE_LOOKUP_PROXY=https://inflight-zmanim.your-name.workers.dev
ROUTE_LOOKUP_PROXY=
